From: LuneOS <webos-ports@googlegroups.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] binder_connman: do not read non-basic property variants

connman_tech_set_property() calls dbus_message_iter_get_basic() on every
technology property variant before looking at its type. libdbus treats
that as a programming error for non-basic types and aborts the process:

    connman_set_techs() /net/connman/technology/p2p
    dbus: type array 97 not a basic type

Newer connman exposes an "Interfaces" property on technology objects whose
variant is an array, so ofonod aborts as soon as it enumerates the
technologies. systemd then restarts it forever - roughly 15 aborts a minute
on a Pixel 3a, taking the whole telephony stack down with it.

The function only ever consumes booleans, so check the type first and bail
out on anything else instead of asking libdbus for a value it cannot give.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
--- a/src/binder_connman.c
+++ b/src/binder_connman.c
@@ -289,17 +289,17 @@
 
     dbus_message_iter_next(it);
     dbus_message_iter_recurse(it, &var);
+    if (dbus_message_iter_get_arg_type(&var) != DBUS_TYPE_BOOLEAN) {
+        /* e.g. "Interfaces", whose variant is an array */
+        return 0;
+    }
     dbus_message_iter_get_basic(&var, &value);
     if (!g_ascii_strcasecmp(key, CONNMAN_TECH_CONNECTED)) {
-        if (dbus_message_iter_get_arg_type(&var) == DBUS_TYPE_BOOLEAN) {
-            connman_set_tech_connected(tech, value.bool_val);
-            return CONNMAN_TECH_CONNECTED_BIT;
-        }
+        connman_set_tech_connected(tech, value.bool_val);
+        return CONNMAN_TECH_CONNECTED_BIT;
     } else if (!g_ascii_strcasecmp(key, CONNMAN_TECH_TETHERING)) {
-        if (dbus_message_iter_get_arg_type(&var) == DBUS_TYPE_BOOLEAN) {
-            connman_set_tech_tethering(tech, value.bool_val);
-            return CONNMAN_TECH_TETHERING_BIT;
-        }
+        connman_set_tech_tethering(tech, value.bool_val);
+        return CONNMAN_TECH_TETHERING_BIT;
     }
     return 0;
 }
